soy sauce","unseasoned rice vinegar","toasted sesame oil","scallion green"]}]', 'published', 'draft', 'global', NULL, 'b48621c12d7f80ab057e171b49bf15a15ba7b6e1b11c54235b3c05671134d101', 'flavorweave-catalog-package', 'catalog/pan-fried-pork-dumplings/v1.json', '2026-10-04T00:00:00.000Z');
